  "question": {
    "html": "<p>An object is released from rest at X and slides to Y. The vertical distance between X and Y is 10 m. During the motion, 20 % of the object’s initial gravitational potential energy is lost as friction.</p>\n<p><figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure></p>\n<p>What is the speed of the object at Y?</p>\n<p>[1]</p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\"><li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{16}{\\sqrt{g}}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"2\\sqrt{g}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"4\\sqrt{g}\"></span></li><li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"8g\"></span></li></ol>"
  },
